## Install

1. Download **Satchel-__VERSION__.dmg** below, open it and drag **Satchel** onto **Applications**.
2. Satchel is signed ad hoc, not notarized by Apple, so macOS blocks the first launch. Open **System Settings → Privacy & Security**, scroll to the message about Satchel and click **Open Anyway**. Or run once in Terminal:
   ```
   xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Satchel.app
   ```
3. Optional: check the download.
   ```
   shasum -a 256 -c Satchel-__VERSION__.dmg.sha256
   ```

Requires macOS 15 or newer, Apple silicon or Intel. Your vault data lives in `~/Library/Application Support/Satchel` and is never touched by an update.
